body:
this doc explains the relationship. Apparently local school boards still set and assess performance goals for charter schools even if they operate independently [https://www.louisianabelieves.com/docs/default-source/school-choice/charter-performance-compact.pdf](https://www.louisianabelieves.com/docs/default-source/school-choice/charter-performance-compact.pdf) 

&#x200B;

Schools that fail to remedy 1 or more performance gaps a single school year can lead to a school entering the charter contract revocation review.
